===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|süezi}}, from {{inh|de|goh|suozi}} (akin to {{cog|osx|swōti}}), from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*swōtī}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*swōtuz}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|*swéh₂dus}}. Compare {{cog|nds|sööt}}, {{cog|nds-de||soit-}} {{q|Paderbornisch}}, {{cog|hrx|sies}}, {{cog|nl|zoet}}, {{cog|en|sweet}}, {{cog|da|sød}}.

